From bf070c2a9af2fad4d0c060dc0d5c81fbc40ee3d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pjgowtham <pjgowtham@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 May 2025 00:16:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] sdm: Support pixelworks soft iris color calibration

Fixes display color calibration with devices that support
pixelworks soft-iris feature. While switching color modes with
stock render intents work, we still haven't reversed the part
where the iris_soft display calibration firmware is generated
during runtime at first boot.

To enable this feature, set the below flag in device specific tree:
$(call soong_config_set,qtidisplay,pxlw_vendor_namespace,vendor/oneplus/sm8450-common)

Co-authored-by: RealJohnGalt <johngaltfirstrun@gmail.com>>
Change-Id: I76d135eef8f0240f5d8f0316d2c4f0679d38c61c
